state phase_launch_dance "Blue flame arcs out of Flare Dancer" in enemy at 2040 80
state phase_launch_still "Flame arcs out of Flare Dancer" in enemy at 2180 80
state phase_dance "Blue flame dances around Link" in enemy at 2040 150
state timer_dance "Blue flame dances around Link: beats left" in enemy at 2180 150
state phase_still "Flame burns in place" in enemy at 2180 220
state timer_still "Flame burns in place: beats left" in enemy at 2040 290
state phase_gone "Flame dies away" in enemy at 2040 360
state hp_flame "Flame: health" marks 1 in enemy_health at 2360 80
state alive_flame "Flame: standing" marks 1 in enemy_health at 2500 80
state dmg_flame "Flame: damage" in enemy_health at 2360 150
state status_burn "Link: burn (beats left)" in link_state at 1220 290
state status_nayru "Link: nayru (beats left)" in link_state at 1080 360
state lens_on "Lens of Truth on" in link_state at 1220 360
