state lens_count "The Lens: beats toward the next cost" in beat at 580 640

verb dance_timer_clears "Blue flame dances around Link is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2040 220
  take timer_dance
  unless phase_dance

verb still_timer_clears "Flame burns in place is over" by world priority 100 in enemy at 2180 290
  take timer_still
  unless phase_still

