  need has_deku_nuts
  give swing_deku_nut
  give enemy_turn

verb link_explosive_1 "Bomb explosion (8 + rot.z high byte; the player spawns it with rot.z 0); AT_TYPE_ALL, so it also hurts Link" by link in link_moves at 2820 80
